---
<Base title={meta.title} description={meta.description}>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap measure">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>18 U.S.C. 2257 Compliance Statement</h1>
    <div class="prose" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
      <p>All models, actors, actresses and other persons that appear in any visual depiction of actual or simulated sexually explicit conduct appearing or otherwise contained in this website were over the age of eighteen (18) years at the time of the creation of such depictions.</p>
      <p>The owner and operator of this website is the producer of all content contained herein, consistent with 18 U.S.C. 2257 and 28 C.F.R. 75. Records required by law to be kept are maintained by the producer.</p>
      <p>Questions regarding this statement may be directed to <a href="mailto:morgan@theeroticmorgan.com">morgan@theeroticmorgan.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>
</Base>
